46 0 obj
<</DA(/Helv 8 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/Kids[ 215 0 R ]/Q 0/Sejda 293 0 R /T(textarea_48lxhq)/V(ABILITIES:\r\n\r\nBroad Training: Gain +1 training in any skill of your choice. This may exceed your linked attribute cap by 1 \(Endurance\)\r\n\r\nIntimidating Presence: Once per Rest, force an enemy to make a DN 16 Resolve Test or be frightened for 1d4 rounds\r\n\r\nCraftsman: You can repair broken gear twice as fast and create simple items given time and materials\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nACTIONS:\r\n\r\nDane Axe - 1d8+Might cutting damage, 2 handed\r\nSpeed: 7 + Might\r\nRange: +1.10m\r\nTraits: Reach, Momentum, Sundering\r\n\r\nBearded Axe - 1d6 + Might cutting damage, one handed\r\nSpeed: 9+Might\r\nRange: 0.55m\r\nTraits: Reliable\r\n\r\nDirk: 1d4+ Might/Grace cutting or piercing damage, one handed\r\nSpeed: 11+Might/Grace\r\nRange: +0.40m\r\nTraits: Reliable, Close Quarters Proficiency, Nimble\r\n\r\nUnarmed Strike: 1d4+Might/Grace\r\nSpeed: 11+Might/Grace)>>
endobj
