52 0 obj
<</DA(/Helv 8 Tf 0 0 0 rg)/FT/Tx/Ff 4096/Kids[ 253 0 R ]/Q 0/Sejda 299 0 R /T(textarea_54xwqb)/V(Dane Axe\(3 carrying capacity\)\r\n3x Bearded Axe\(2 carrying capacity per axe\)\r\nDirk\(1 carrying capacity\)\r\nChainmail\(3 DR, -2 evasion, -2m run, -1m walk, -2m climb, -1m jump\)\r\nGood Quality Plate Mail\(6 DR, -3 evasion,  -2m run, -1m walk, -2m climb, -1m jump\)\r\nUsed Waterskin\(weightless\)\r\n4 Rations\(weightless\)\r\n\r\nMana Stones A+B \(2 cc per stone\)\r\nMana Stone C\(weightless\)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nInventory Space: 18)>>
